text = "• Pick Easy / Normal / Hard on the menu (saved for next launch).
• Earn Scrap from kills; place turrets (max 3, or 4 with meta).
• BUILD / UPGRADE / SELL modes on the battle HUD.
• Survive 5 waves (Brute on 4–5) to win.
• Earn Stars on win/lose; spend them in META SHOP.
• Reset Meta in the shop clears Stars + upgrades (not difficulty)."
